= Scientific Department

The Scientific Department is one of the main department of the SCP Foundation and is responsible for researching, interacting, and testing anomalous entities within Foundation perimeters.

It currently is the most critical department considering the lost of research about anomalous entities.

- @fund
- @research
- @fund_niche
- @root: Return to main

@fund
title: Increase funding for the Scientific Department
choose-if: scidep_action_timer = 0 and funds > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if scidep_action_timer > 0 : [+ scidep_action_timer +] months before next department action. ?][? if funds > 0 and scidep_action_timer = 0: Not enough funds. ?]
on-arrival: scidep_action_timer = 6; scidep_funds +=1; funds -= 1

We have increased fundings towards the Scientific Department

@research
title: Exert effort into continuing our research
unavailable-subtitle: [? if scidep_action_timer > 0 : [+ scidep_action_timer +] months before the next department action. ?]
choose-if: scidep_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: scidep_action_timer = 6; research += 1

We have put effort into continuing and improving our research.

@fund_niche
title: Increase funding for a useless branch in the Scientific Department
unavailable-subtitle:[? if scidep_action_timer > 0 : [+ scidep_action_timer +] months before next department action. ?][? if funds <= 0 and scidep_action_timer = 0 : Not enough funds. ?]
view-if: antimeme_division_scene = 1
choose-if: scidep_action_timer = 0 and funds >= 1                                                                              
on-arrival: scidep_action_timer = 6; antimeme_funds += 1; funds -= 1

We have put focus on funding this useless branch in the Scientific Department, however, the other departments are not pleased with us funding this useless branch.
